---
/**
 * Hero device — the lab mark at emblem scale.
 *
 * The same geometry as `public/logo-health.svg`, redrawn with token-driven
 * classes instead of literal colours so it follows the dark mode and needs no
 * background plate: the page paper reads through it, and the paper-filled nodes
 * mask the arms beneath them in either mode.
 *
 * A monitored clinical signal (P wave, QRS complex, T wave) crosses a ring that
 * four contributing sites feed. That is the lab's thesis compressed into a mark
 * rather than plotted as a figure — the masthead above it is centred, so the
 * radial symmetry belongs here.
 */
---

<figure class="hero-emblem">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 460 460" role="img" aria-labelledby="emblem-title emblem-desc">
    <title id="emblem-title">IASO-SAI Lab</title>
    <desc id="emblem-desc">
      The lab mark: a clinical pulse trace crossing a ring, with four
      contributing sites connected to it on the diagonals.
    </desc>

    <g aria-hidden="true">
      <!-- Arms run to the node centres; the paper-filled nodes cover the ends. -->
      <path class="emblem-arm" d="M309 151L389 71 M309 309L389 389 M151 309L71 389 M151 151L71 71" />

      <circle class="emblem-ring" cx="230" cy="230" r="112" />

      <path
        class="emblem-trace"
        d="M47 230H168L180 212L192 230H206L212 246L230 130L248 252L258 230H278L296 208L314 230H413"
      />

      <circle class="emblem-node" cx="389" cy="71" r="18" />
      <circle class="emblem-node" cx="389" cy="389" r="18" />
      <circle class="emblem-node" cx="71" cy="389" r="18" />
      <circle class="emblem-node" cx="71" cy="71" r="18" />
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    The lab mark: a monitored clinical signal, read across four contributing
    sites.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
